  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustaining Himalyan Water Resources in a Changing Climate (SusHi-Wat)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding to support coordination and knowledge exchange activities for the SWR programme which aims to understand basin processes affecting water security. This will facilitate the development of sustainable basin-wide water management strategies to ensure India&#x2019;s water security</narrative>
  </description>
